%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6","start":0,"end":21,"text":"史臣曰后妃之德著自風謠義起閨房而道化天下繰"},{"column":"6L07","pdf_page":6,"half":"左","leaf":"5上","column_from_right":7,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6","start":0,"end":21,"text":"盆獻種罔非耕織佩管晨興與子同事可以光熙閫業"},{"column":"6L08","pdf_page":6,"half":"左","leaf":"5上","column_from_right":8,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6","start":0,"end":21,"text":"作儷公侯孝昭二后並有賢明之訓不得母臨萬國寶"},{"column":"6L09","pdf_page":6,"half":"左","leaf":"5上","column_from_right":9,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6","start":0,"end":21,"text":"命方昌椒庭虛位有婦人焉空慕周興禎符顯瑞徒萃"},{"column":"6L10","pdf_page":6,"half":"左","leaf":"5上","column_from_right":10,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6","start":0,"end":21,"text":"徽名若使掖作同休陰教遠燮則馬鄧風流復存乎此"},{"column":"7R01","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":1,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":21,"text":"太祖創命宮禁貶約毀宋明之紫極革前代之踰奢衣"},{"column":"7R02","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":2,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":21,"text":"不文繡色無紅采永巷貧空有同素室世祖嗣位運藉"},{"column":"7R03","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":3,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":21,"text":"休平壽昌前興鳳華晚構香栢文檉花梁繡柱雕金鏤"},{"column":"7R04","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":4,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":21,"text":"寶頗用房帷趙瑟吳趨承閑奏曲歲費傍恩足使充牣"},{"column":"7R05","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":5,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":21,"text":"事由私蓄無損國儲高宗仗數矯情外行儉陋內奉宮"},{"column":"7R06","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":6,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":21,"text":"業曾莫云改東昏喪道侈風大扇銷糜海內以贍浮飾"},{"column":"7R07","pdf_page":7,"half":"右","leaf":"5下","column_from_right":7,"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7","start":0,"end":18,"text":"哲婦傾城同符殷夏嗚呼所以垂戒於方來也"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-020-consorts-editorial-wyd","book_id":"b-nanqishu-020","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-020-consorts-editorial-wyd"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-020-consorts-editorial:p002","text":"史臣曰：后妃之德，著自風謠，義起閨房，而道化天下。繰盆獻種，罔非耕織，佩管晨興，與子同事，可以光熙閫業，作儷公侯。孝、昭二后，竝有賢明之訓，不得母臨萬國。寶命方昌，椒庭虛位，有婦人焉，空慕周興，禎符顯瑞，徒萃徽名。若使掖作同休，陰教遠爕，則馬、鄧風流，復存乎此。太祖創命，宮禁貶約，毀宋明之紫極，革前代之踰奢，衣不文繡，色無紅采，永巷貧空，有同素室。世祖嗣位，運藉休平，壽昌前興，鳳華晚搆，香柏文檉，花梁繡柱，雕金鏤寶，頗用房帷，趙瑟吳趨，承閑奏曲，歲費傍恩，足使充牣，事由私蓄，無損國儲。高宗仗數矯情，外行儉陋，內奉宮業，曾莫云改。東昏喪道，侈風大扇，銷糜海內，以贍浮飾，哲婦傾城，同符殷、夏。嗚呼！所以垂戒於方來〔也〕。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[],"source_position":{"revision_id":2074177,"first_line":55,"last_line":55,"source_layer":"historian_appraisal","raw_start":2971,"raw_end":3443,"raw_character_offsets":[2971,2972,2973,2974,297